  "code": "INELIG",
  "loc": "Section 1 Introduction, p. 2049; Section 2 Preliminaries, p. 2050",
  "quote": "players form coalitions, and the coalition with the largest cumulative weight",
  "note": "The main object is a cooperative coalition-formation game (a partition function game in which coalitions win prizes by total weight). It studies core-type stability, Pareto efficiency and complexity. No procedure aggregates agents' submitted inputs (ballots, preferences) into a collective decision by voting. 'Weighted voting game' here names a class of simple cooperative games, not a voting rule. Coding stopped."
